# Template for the STAGING_ENV_FILE and PRODUCTION_ENV_FILE GitHub secrets.
# Fill in real values and paste the whole text into the secret. Use different
# values for staging and production. Never commit the filled-in version.
# Generate random values in Git Bash: openssl rand -hex 32
# The workflow adds IMAGE, DEPLOY_ENV, SITE_DOMAIN and DB_TUNNEL_PORT itself.

# PostgreSQL passwords (each: openssl rand -hex 24)
DB_OWNER_PASSWORD=
APP_DB_PASSWORD=

# Signs temporary links to uploaded files (openssl rand -hex 32)
FILE_URL_SECRET=

# Protects /api/public/cron/* (openssl rand -hex 32)
CRON_SECRET=

# Required for registration, confirmation, password reset and email change.
# Without SMTP_URL email actions are unavailable; links are never logged.
# Any SMTP provider works; URL-encode the username and password.
# Resend: SMTP_URL=smtps://resend:RESEND_API_KEY@smtp.resend.com:465
# SMTP_URL=
# MAIL_FROM=Sportura <noreply@sportura.kz>

# Optional: Google sign-in. Authorized redirect URI in Google Cloud Console:
# https://sportura.kz/api/auth/google/callback (production)
# https://staging.sportura.kz/api/auth/google/callback (staging)
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
